WEBVTT

00:02.235 --> 00:03.702
Legend has it...

00:04.871 --> 00:07.669
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons.

00:08.008 --> 00:13.344
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:14.815 --> 00:19.980
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.100 --> 00:40.529
<i>The Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:40.807 --> 00:46.643
<i>Rushing through my innocent</i>
<i>youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.181 --> 00:54.086
<i>This soul of mine is</i>
<i>so easy to influence.</i>

00:55.756 --> 00:59.522
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

00:59.626 --> 01:02.823
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:06.600 --> 01:13.665
<i>This is what I'm wishing</i>
<i>for as I sing this song.</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:19.676
<i>I want you to acknowledge</i>
<i>me, that's all.</i>

01:20.547 --> 01:27.817
<i>You smiled at me for</i>
<i>the very first time.</i>

01:27.988 --> 01:36.396
<i>Thank you so much, thank you</i>
<i>from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.097 --> 01:38.758
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:48.508 --> 01:51.944
<i>The Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

01:53.714 --> 01:58.413
Now then, I leave the Young Miss
in your care, Lord Mutsu!

01:58.852 --> 02:00.683
So you're going to do it after all?

02:02.622 --> 02:03.748
Mouth needles?

02:03.857 --> 02:04.755
What the hell?

02:05.959 --> 02:06.618
Young Miss!

02:08.929 --> 02:09.918
Iemitsu!

02:10.030 --> 02:12.726
I, Tsubura, the daughter
of Saemonnosuke Sanada...

02:12.833 --> 02:14.562
...have come to claim your head!

02:22.509 --> 02:23.407
Sasuke!

02:34.187 --> 02:36.951
Lord Ono, allow me to
take care of this man...

02:41.528 --> 02:43.621
S-Samon!

02:49.236 --> 02:52.137
Damn you! You and your death wish...

02:53.240 --> 02:55.765
So you had to go and
get yourself killed!

02:58.011 --> 02:59.410
You bastard...

03:03.717 --> 03:04.741
Tadatsune!

03:08.688 --> 03:10.656
We're leaving now, Tsubura!

03:10.891 --> 03:11.789
No!

03:12.025 --> 03:13.253
Sasuke's dead!

03:13.760 --> 03:16.092
First I'll kill Iemitsu, and then...

03:16.963 --> 03:18.521
...I'll die in battle!

03:19.032 --> 03:20.465
You idiot!

03:20.700 --> 03:22.725
Don't you understand why Sasuke...

03:22.836 --> 03:25.669
...missed on purpose with
that last dagger of his?

03:27.541 --> 03:30.669
And is it really worth it to take
the head of a loser like that?

03:31.711 --> 03:33.736
Please...

03:33.947 --> 03:36.177
Just don't kill me!

03:36.683 --> 03:38.412
I-I'll make you a daimyo...

03:39.319 --> 03:41.753
All right? Please!

03:44.958 --> 03:47.688
And you call yourself
the goddamned Shogun?

03:56.469 --> 03:57.868
Hurry, hurry!

03:58.004 --> 03:59.471
You must protect His Highness!

04:06.446 --> 04:07.435
Your Highness!

04:09.049 --> 04:10.573
Don't move a muscle.

04:10.717 --> 04:14.414
Or else I'll break this moron's neck!

04:15.856 --> 04:16.823
Takato!

04:17.390 --> 04:18.322
Tsubura!

04:19.726 --> 04:22.217
What'll it be, your father's Muramasa?

04:25.031 --> 04:27.966
Or will you choose Sasuke?

04:29.569 --> 04:33.130
If you have that sword on your back
you won't be able to carry Sasuke.

04:34.007 --> 04:37.101
Which one are you going
to take home with you?

04:45.285 --> 04:46.684
Of course, I choose Sasuke.

05:00.133 --> 05:04.160
It's all right, everyone, stand back!

05:04.905 --> 05:06.372
Let them pass.

05:20.620 --> 05:21.678
Jubei!

05:24.991 --> 05:27.118
J-Jubei...

05:27.327 --> 05:29.192
You don't have to...

05:29.696 --> 05:32.529
Just let them pass.

05:35.335 --> 05:36.597
But I don't want to, my lord!

05:47.347 --> 05:48.314
Takato!

05:50.750 --> 05:52.012
Good job, Jubei!

05:52.118 --> 05:53.847
Now's your chance! Kill him right now!

05:54.421 --> 05:56.446
Your Highness! Hurry, come this way!

05:58.825 --> 05:59.348
Tsubura!

05:59.459 --> 06:00.426
Stay back!

06:01.628 --> 06:04.722
If you come any closer
I'll crush his neck!

06:04.864 --> 06:07.833
Step back at least
10 ken away from me!

06:09.235 --> 06:12.295
All of you, step back right now!

06:12.572 --> 06:15.564
Jubei, put down your sword.
Otherwise...

06:15.709 --> 06:17.734
Go ahead and do whatever you want!

06:18.378 --> 06:19.504
Jubei!

06:19.846 --> 06:22.041
The one I'm after...

06:24.451 --> 06:25.850
...is you!

06:26.353 --> 06:27.877
Don't do it, Takato!

06:28.989 --> 06:33.653
It's no good! No one stands a
chance against him in combat!

06:35.128 --> 06:39.030
Apparently, I don't
really have a choice...

06:42.535 --> 06:45.504
You have no chance!
You said so yourself!

06:48.108 --> 06:50.076
But I can beat him now.

06:50.577 --> 06:53.239
I was just Takato when
I told you that, but now...

06:55.915 --> 07:00.352
...I stand before you as Takato Mutsu!

07:07.260 --> 07:10.320
So he's actually a true Mutsu?

07:10.964 --> 07:15.094
So he was on to me from the start,
but went along with my charade?

07:17.370 --> 07:23.036
I see, no wonder I
recognized that kodachi...

07:24.010 --> 07:27.639
So Yakumo did have a
child, except it's Takato!

07:39.092 --> 07:41.424
What is this ki?

07:42.262 --> 07:45.754
Is this his true identity?

07:46.099 --> 07:47.498
Is this...

07:49.135 --> 07:51.968
Is this Mutsu?

07:59.212 --> 08:02.443
I knew you were just like me...

08:07.987 --> 08:12.390
...just an idiot who only wants
to duel a worthy opponent!

08:31.478 --> 08:32.274
What?

08:38.885 --> 08:41.285
What was that kick?

08:49.929 --> 08:51.556
What power!

08:52.532 --> 08:57.196
He truly reminds me of Lord Yakumo
on the day he battled Lord Musashi.

09:02.775 --> 09:04.709
You're a great fighter!

09:09.415 --> 09:12.009
I guess I can't beat
you with just one eye!

09:14.387 --> 09:15.786
Lord Tajima!

09:16.122 --> 09:19.489
He's always had the use of both eyes.

09:20.226 --> 09:23.684
But as part of his training,
he covered his right eye.

09:23.897 --> 09:27.424
He's the kind of man who'd do
anything to become stronger.

09:28.434 --> 09:29.901
Interesting...

09:30.103 --> 09:33.539
So someone else had
the same idea I did.

09:33.706 --> 09:36.038
And to be so thorough!

09:55.762 --> 09:57.093
I can see you now!

10:10.109 --> 10:12.304
That was a good job of dodging.

10:16.849 --> 10:18.544
What a beast...

10:19.285 --> 10:22.812
Now that Jubei's using both
of his eyes, can I say...

10:22.956 --> 10:26.016
...he's a match for Lord Musashi?

10:31.631 --> 10:32.563
It's no good...

10:33.066 --> 10:34.533
He can see right through him now...

10:36.569 --> 10:38.161
What power...

10:39.138 --> 10:41.333
Your skills are beyond any human
being!

10:44.911 --> 10:49.314
However I am even
more powerful than you!

10:50.683 --> 10:54.676
You're going to need at least
one more eye to defeat me!

11:19.445 --> 11:20.878
I don't believe it...

11:24.083 --> 11:26.017
What's with these two?

11:27.720 --> 11:29.745
Can they really be human?

12:41.561 --> 12:43.552
He's swinging his sword
upwards in the same blow?

12:47.133 --> 12:48.327
He can't get out of the way!

12:54.574 --> 12:57.475
Huh? Is he actually stepping in?

13:02.315 --> 13:04.215
I didn't slash deep enough...

13:09.222 --> 13:10.712
I can evade that!

13:25.805 --> 13:28.603
I'm glad I got the chance to duel you...

13:29.909 --> 13:34.778
I never thought I'd get
to fight a Shura like you...

13:53.399 --> 13:55.333
He truly is a beast...

13:55.635 --> 14:00.538
They say that a beast takes
over when you become a Shura...

14:02.308 --> 14:06.404
If it was just his fist, you could've
gotten out of the way, Jubei...

14:07.046 --> 14:11.039
Who would've thought
he'd use his finger?

14:13.019 --> 14:15.214
J-Jubei!

14:17.123 --> 14:19.387
He won!

14:20.259 --> 14:24.992
He really managed to pull
off a win against Jubei!

14:27.600 --> 14:31.195
Now then, let's go home. Tsubura...

14:42.849 --> 14:45.943
Now! You must rescue the Shogun now!

14:46.452 --> 14:47.441
Izu!

14:48.855 --> 14:50.254
Your Highness!

14:56.529 --> 14:57.655
She's still alive!

14:57.763 --> 14:58.422
Finish her off!

14:58.531 --> 14:59.361
Sir!

15:09.675 --> 15:11.040
You bastards...

15:11.677 --> 15:14.237
You want to fight me to
the bitter end, is that it?

15:16.816 --> 15:18.044
Muskets!

15:18.217 --> 15:18.945
Yes, sir!

15:28.561 --> 15:29.528
Kill them now!

15:30.329 --> 15:32.024
They no longer have a hostage!

15:32.398 --> 15:33.490
Fools!

15:34.333 --> 15:36.426
All they had to do
is leave them alone...

16:05.464 --> 16:07.591
Which one of you wants to be...

16:08.834 --> 16:09.801
...the next to die?

16:16.442 --> 16:18.569
Give it up, Mozaemon.

16:19.245 --> 16:21.645
You are no match for that man.

16:24.417 --> 16:25.645
Father!

16:27.253 --> 16:31.349
Tell me how I can become
as powerful as him!

16:33.626 --> 16:35.150
Training...

16:35.928 --> 16:39.921
Train so hard that you lose
your humanity, I suppose.

16:44.770 --> 16:45.634
Tsubura!

16:48.774 --> 16:50.139
I'm all right.

16:51.043 --> 16:52.567
Sasuke...

16:53.846 --> 16:58.010
Sasuke's body protected
me one last time.

17:03.456 --> 17:04.218
No...

17:05.691 --> 17:08.558
I'll carry Sasuke.

17:09.629 --> 17:15.033
Sasuke was the father I never had!

17:24.777 --> 17:27.575
Let's go home.

17:41.527 --> 17:44.985
Do you want to die, Iori Miyamoto?

17:57.910 --> 18:01.277
If you want to live, then
you must let them pass!

18:04.917 --> 18:07.249
Please give my regards to Lord
Yakumo.

18:08.421 --> 18:14.553
Unfortunately, there's no beast in
my soul fierce enough to take you on.

18:18.831 --> 18:20.765
That's right...

18:21.534 --> 18:23.559
Takato Mutsu...

18:24.170 --> 18:27.970
No one can hold their own
against a beast like you...

18:29.108 --> 18:32.908
...except me or Musashi, that's it.

18:39.652 --> 18:41.517
I really enjoyed our duel.

18:43.155 --> 18:47.285
Listen, you. Don't ever
forget the name Jubei.

18:47.626 --> 18:50.754
If you ever get bored,
come down and see me...

18:52.565 --> 18:54.863
I'll take you on anytime!

19:00.840 --> 19:02.774
I'll do that.

19:18.124 --> 19:19.182
Jubei!

19:22.528 --> 19:25.361
I, Iori Miyamoto have just told you...

19:25.965 --> 19:31.164
...everything I saw happen at
the Kan-Ei Shogun's Tournament.

19:34.774 --> 19:38.301
But the truth never came out...

19:38.410 --> 19:43.040
...because the Tokugawa Clan
sealed it away in the shadows.

19:49.388 --> 19:52.721
Sixteen years later...

19:53.392 --> 19:58.091
Lord Jubei Mitsuyoshi Yagyu
died suddenly while hunting...

19:58.264 --> 20:03.600
...in the village of Ookawara
in Yamashiro Province...

20:14.413 --> 20:18.406
Some say he was poisoned, others
say he succumbed to illness...

20:18.951 --> 20:24.912
...but he died with a mysteriously
satisfied smile on his face...

20:26.158 --> 20:29.650
Master, is that story true?

20:32.665 --> 20:36.692
Only time really knows the truth...

21:09.101 --> 21:11.331
We had a good time...

21:11.871 --> 21:13.270
Yes.

21:14.406 --> 21:19.537
<i>The Beast</i>

21:32.191 --> 21:44.228
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at</i>
<i>them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:44.503 --> 21:54.242
<i>My loneliness and the vast night</i>
<i>sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:54.380 --> 22:03.379
<i>I just don't know what this</i>
<i>dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:03.522 --> 22:14.194
<i>Even if it's just "hello,"</i>
<i>I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.234 --> 22:21.366
<i>The person I am today</i>
<i>is about to disappear...</i>

22:21.740 --> 22:24.732
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:25.544 --> 22:31.881
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.184 --> 22:37.679
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:52.371 --> 22:56.808
Ryoma Sakamoto, the man whose skills
caught my eye in a kenjutsu match.

22:57.009 --> 23:00.035
Hey, I know you're a lot
more powerful than that!

23:00.612 --> 23:02.307
Next episode of the Age of Chaos...

23:02.448 --> 23:03.847
<i>The Slumbering Dragon</i>

23:03.949 --> 23:06.315
Pay close attention, and wait!
